// Chapter 1: The Grind. What happens after each event and each night, and the lines that change with the job.

title: BeforeEvent
---
// the Classic has its own opener, the first time you sit down in it
<<if $event == "classic" and not $classic_seen>>
    <<set $classic_seen to true>>
    <<film classic>>
<<endif>>
===

title: AfterEvent
---
// the first tournament ends the prologue: the job decision
<<if $event == "local">>
    <<jump Decision>>
<<endif>>
<<if $chapter == 1 and $bankroll < 60>>
    <<detour Broke>>
<<endif>>
<<if $event == "classic">>
    <<if $won>>
        <<film classic_win>>
    <<elseif not $classic_lose_seen>>
        <<set $classic_lose_seen to true>>
        <<film classic_lose>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
<<if $mistake and not $needle_seen>>
    <<set $needle_seen to true>>
    <<film needle>>
<<endif>>
<<if $bust and not $lesson_seen>>
    <<set $lesson_seen to true>>
    <<film lesson1>>
<<endif>>
<<detour CheckGoal>>
===

title: AfterSleep
---
// a paycheck can reach the goal on its own (the old game checks progress after every night)
<<detour CheckGoal>>
===

title: CheckGoal
---
<<if $chapter == 1 and ($room_title or $bankroll >= 10000)>>
    <<jump ChapterEnd>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Broke
---
// rock bottom: Slick's way out depends on the job (old broke / broke_n)
Slick: Busted? Good. Now you're a poker player. Everybody goes broke once. #text
<<if $job == "nights">>
    Slick: You've still got Lou's paycheck. Here's $1,000 till it builds back. Half your profits come back to me until it's paid. #text
<<else>>
    Slick: No paycheck to fall back on. Here's $1,000. Half your profits come back to me until it's paid. Respect the roll this time. #text
<<endif>>
<<stake 1000>>
===

title: ChapterEnd
---
// with the day job, David texts first at ten thousand (old david1); then the goal and the end of the beta
<<if $job == "nights" and $peak >= 10000 and not $david_seen>>
    <<set $david_seen to true>>
    David: TEN THOUSAND?? FROM POKER?? AND YOU STILL WENT TO WORK TODAY??? #text
    David: im just saying. lou doesnt deserve you. the felt does #text
<<endif>>
<<set $chapter to 2>>
<<film goal>>
<<film end>>
===
